pageType: content
background:
  type: solid
  color: "$bodybg"
elements:
  - elementId: kicker
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 26, 400, 18]
    content: {style: "$kicker", wrap: false, text: "02 · 测试策略"}
  - elementId: title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 46, 720, 34]
    content: {style: "$pagetitle", wrap: false, text: 策略组合：黑盒 + 白盒 + 最小集成}
  - elementId: secnum
    elementType: text
    bounds: [832, 22, 80, 38]
    content: {fontSize: 28, bold: true, color: "$soft", align: [right, middle], wrap: false, text: "02"}
  - elementId: hrule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 92, 864, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: hrule-accent
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 90, 56, 2]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$accent"}
  - elementId: g1-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 110, 440, 20]
    content: {fontSize: 13, bold: true, color: "$ink", wrap: false, text: 黑盒测试 · 数据集（95 项）}
  - elementId: g1-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 132, 440, 88]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 12
      text: |
        <p>等价类划分 29 · 边界值 35 · 场景法 24 · 判定表 / 状态转换等 7；</p>
        <p>覆盖参数验证、模态文件配对、采样与训练 / 验证划分、patch 与 GT 空间对齐、加载异常恢复。</p>
  - elementId: g1-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 230, 440, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: g2-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 244, 440, 20]
    content: {fontSize: 13, bold: true, color: "$ink", wrap: false, text: 白盒测试 · 损失与指标（103 项）}
  - elementId: g2-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 266, 440, 66]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 12
      text: 按语句、分支、条件、路径四级覆盖组织；损失函数做精确数值与梯度验证，指标函数做参数校验与单位换算验证。
  - elementId: g2-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 342, 440, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: g3-label
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 356, 440, 20]
    content: {fontSize: 13, bold: true, color: "$ink", wrap: false, text: 最小集成（1 项）}
  - elementId: g3-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 378, 440, 66]
    content:
      style: "$body"
      fontSize: 12
      text: 数据集 → DataLoader → 小型 Conv2d → 损失反向传播，验证批处理到损失的接口连通；不代表完整 TRD 训练。
  - elementId: chart-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [540, 110, 372, 18]
    content: {fontSize: 11, bold: true, color: "$primary", wrap: false, text: 用例分布（按功能组，单位：项）}
  - elementId: dist-chart
    elementType: chart
    bounds: [520, 132, 392, 170]
    fontFamily: {latin: "Liter", ea: "MiSans"}
    data:
      cols: [功能组, 用例数]
      rows:
        - [数据集黑盒, 95]
        - [损失与指标白盒, 103]
        - [最小集成, 1]
    series:
      - type: bar
        encode: {x: 用例数, y: 功能组}
        fill: "$primary"
        dataLabels: {show: true, fontSize: 10, color: "#FFFFFF"}
    legend: false
    barWidth: 0.55
    xAxis: {type: value, max: 120, gridLine: {style: dot, color: "$hairline"}, label: {fontSize: 9, color: "$muted"}}
    yAxis: {type: category, reverse: true, gridLine: false, label: {fontSize: 10, color: "$ink"}}
  - elementId: map-line
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [540, 316, 372, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: map-title
    elementType: text
    bounds: [540, 328, 372, 18]
    content: {fontSize: 11, bold: true, color: "$primary", wrap: false, text: 需求 → 用例映射（示例）}
  - elementId: map-text
    elementType: text
    bounds: [540, 350, 372, 108]
    content:
      fontSize: 10.5
      color: "$ink"
      lineHeight: 1.65
      text: |
        <p>「数量参数优先于比例」→ test_count_overrides_ratio</p>
        <p>「patch 与 GT 空间一致」→ test_rgb_depth_gt_alignment[4/8/16]</p>
        <p>「测量次数须有效」→ test_latency_invalid_runs[0/-1/1.5/True]</p>
  - elementId: strategy-note
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 460, 864, 36]
    content:
      style: "$small"
      text: 方法选择依据：输入空间复杂 → 等价类与边界值；多参数组合 → 判定表；加载过程有状态 → 状态转换；数值正确性 → 精确值与梯度断言。199 项用例均建立需求到用例的对应关系。
  - elementId: frule
    elementType: shape
    bounds: [48, 508, 864, 1]
    shapeName: rect
    fill: {type: solid, color: "$hairline"}
  - elementId: fleft
    elementType: text
    bounds: [48, 514, 400, 14]
    content: {fontSize: 9, color: "$muted", wrap: false, text: 软件测试与质量保证实践 · 模块一成果汇报}
  - elementId: fright
    elementType: text
    bounds: [812, 514, 100, 14]
    content: {fontSize: 9, color: "$muted", align: [right, top], wrap: false, text: "05 / 12"}
